        "jsCode": "let leads = $input.all().map((item) => item.json);\n\nleads.sort(() => Math.random() - 0.5);\n\nlet limit = $(\"On form submission\").all()[0].json[\"No. of leads\"];\n\nlet selectedLeads = leads.slice(0, limit);\n\nreturn selectedLeads.map((l) => ({ json: l }));\n"
